BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Introverts
UID:event_314402238@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260423T040210Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T140000
SUMMARY:Small Town Adventure Series — Brevard\, NC
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\n**📣 Cross-posted from Asheville Trans
 plants**\n\nJoin us for the next installment of the Small Town Adventure s
 eries in Brevard! About 45 minutes southwest of Asheville\, Brevard is kno
 wn for its waterfalls\, white squirrels\, and outdoorsy-meets-artsy vibe. 
 This one leans a bit more into nature while still keeping the social + wal
 kable format.\n\nStay for the full day\, or drop in to whichever event(s) 
 pique your interest!\n\n⸻\n\nItinerary for the Day\n\n☕ 10:00–10:45 
 AM — Breakfast & Coffee at Cup & Saucer\n\nLocal favorite with great cof
 fee\, breakfast plates\, and a cozy small-town feel. Perfect place to kick
  things off.\n\n⸻\n\n🌿 11:00–12:00 PM — Walk at Brevard Music Cen
 ter\n\nEasy scenic walk around the campus and lake.\nSlight upgrade from p
 revious walks — more nature\, still very accessible.\n\n⸻\n\n🛍️ 1
 2:00–12:45 PM — Explore Downtown Brevard\n\nStroll Main Street—some 
 highlights:\n• O.P. Taylor’s — iconic toy store (worth seeing even a
 s an adult)\n• Highland Books — great indie bookstore\n• White squir
 rel sightings (seriously — keep an eye out)\n\n⸻\n\n🍻 1:00–2:00 P
 M — Lunch + Drinks at Oskar Blues Brewery Taproom\n\nWrap up with casual
  food\, local beer\, and a lively but still relaxed atmosphere.\n\n⸻\n\n
 Why Brevard?\n• Stronger nature element (this differentiates the series)
 \n• Still has a walkable\, charming downtown\n• Unique local identity 
 (white squirrels + music culture)\n• Feels like a mini getaway\, not jus
 t a nearby town
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/314402238
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260421T173224Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T173224Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
