SUMMARY:Sunset Picnic
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome enjoy one of the great views you do
 n’t need to hike to!\nWe’ll pick a grassy spot to hang out picnic styl
 e so bring a blanket or chair and your own food or something to share.\n\n
 Jump Off Rock does not have picnic tables or restrooms.\n**Bring your own 
 food\, drinks\, and seating (a standard outdoor chair is great)!**
